            <ArticleTitle>[Therapeutic difficulties in a 3 year-old boy with Kawasaki disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1273-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of a three year-old by with delayed diagnosis of disease is presented. Treatment with immunoglobulins and methylpreduisolone was affective, however, no regression in coronary artery lesions was observed. The diagnosis and treatment of Kawasaki disease are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
